NT hospital in Palwal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Palwal hospital is located at Asha Tower, Ground Floor, New Sohna Road, near Ambedkar College, Palwal, Haryana – 121103."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Dr. Dhirendra Singh Kushwah visit Palwal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Dr. Dhirendra Singh Kushwah is available at the Palwal hospital every Tuesday by prior appointment. The ENT team is available 24×7."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What ENT problems are treated in Palwal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"ENT care includes ear infections, hearing problems, sinusitis, nasal blockage, allergies, tonsil problems, throat disorders, voice problems, vertigo and other ear, nose and throat conditions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is sinus treatment available in Palwal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Patients with sinusitis, chronic sinus problems, nasal blockage and related conditions can receive ENT evaluation and appropriate medical or surgical treatment."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I consult for hearing loss in Palwal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Hearing loss and other ear-related concerns can be evaluated by an ENT specialist. Depending on the cause, further hearing assessment, medical treatment or advanced intervention may be recommended."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I book an ENT appointment in Palwal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can contact the clinic at +91-9311449825 to enquire about availability and schedule an appointment with Dr. Dhirendra Singh Kushwah."}}]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.drdhirendrasinghkushwah.in/location/palwal#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.drdhirendrasinghkushwah.in/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Locations","item":"https://www.drdhirendrasinghkushwah.in/location"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Palwal","it